        {
          "book": "DEU",
          "chapter": 2,
          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "Then we turned, and took our journey into the wilderness by the way to the Red Sea, as the LORD spoke to me; and we encircled Mount Seir many days.",
      "ko": "우리가 회정하여 여호와께서 내게 명하신대로 홍해 길로 광야에 들어가서 여러날 동안 세일산을 두루 행하더니",
      "source_text_hash": "779f7f356ce89cb1e367a47ddb20b17b98a61f8d4e6d6adf30cdc9058a175b69",
      "translation_text_hash": "a757986be30c1284983d54062bc9d0dd001c9fd44cf67e2c89a4e5ed3d263789",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "우리가 회정하여 여호와께서 내게 명하신대로 홍해 길로 광야에 들어가서 여러날 동안 세일산을 두루 행하더니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "a757986be30c1284983d54062bc9d0dd001c9fd44cf67e2c89a4e5ed3d263789"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:DEU:2:2",
      "sequence": 4941,
